==Slovene==

===Etymology===
From the noun '''[[Danec#Slovene|Danec]]''' + the general possessive suffix '''[[-ski#Slovene|-ski]]'''.

===Adjective===
'''danski'''  {{m}}

# [[Danish]] (of a nation, its language, or its culture)
#: ''časopis '''danski'''''
#:: ''a '''Danish''' newspaper''

====Usage notes====
* Unlike most Slovene adjectives, '''danski''' has no specifically indefinite form.  The definite form also serves as the indefinite form.

